{"real": true, "dur": 15.52, "sent": [{"start": 0.22, "end": 3.8, "text": "As the name suggests, the whole thing is organised around goals.", "words": [{"w": "As", "s": 0.22}, {"w": "the", "s": 0.36}, {"w": "name", "s": 0.5}, {"w": "suggests,", "s": 0.74}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.62}, {"w": "whole", "s": 1.72}, {"w": "thing", "s": 1.98}, {"w": "is", "s": 2.18}, {"w": "organised", "s": 2.4}, {"w": "around", "s": 2.96}, {"w": "goals.", "s": 3.32}]}, {"start": 4.5, "end": 8.24, "text": "I call them goals, but they’re really what teachers know as learning objectives.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 4.5}, {"w": "call", "s": 4.54}, {"w": "them", "s": 4.76}, {"w": "goals,", "s": 5.0}, {"w": "but", "s": 5.6}, {"w": "they’re", "s": 5.74}, {"w": "really", "s": 5.92}, {"w": "what", "s": 6.22}, {"w": "teachers", "s": 6.4}, {"w": "know", "s": 6.86}, {"w": "as", "s": 7.16}, {"w": "learning", "s": 7.38}, {"w": "objectives.", "s": 7.66}]}, {"start": 8.76, "end": 14.76, "text": "And the communicative goals are much like what ACTFL calls can-do statements.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 8.76}, {"w": "the", "s": 9.58}, {"w": "communicative", "s": 9.76}, {"w": "goals", "s": 10.46}, {"w": "are", "s": 11.12}, {"w": "much", "s": 11.28}, {"w": "like", "s": 11.58}, {"w": "what", "s": 11.9}, {"w": "ACTFL", "s": 12.22}, {"w": "calls", "s": 13.08}, {"w": "can-do", "s": 13.66}, {"w": "statements.", "s": 14.2}]}]}